        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9221f038665ddc302a73cb70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我重复着这个词，深有同感地点头。\n那场几乎同时冲线，却仍然\n夺下橡树女王之位的比赛――",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c479be43df07e5978e8f75ceb52289b240c9f8eaf5b0aba250a89a46b9183b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1250edb0e390b53d3af6f24a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的母亲在那里展现出了气概。骨气。\n无论置身多么严酷的战斗\n都要夺取荣耀，那副强大的身姿――",
      "source_fingerprint": "898d93549382027c579cc7d1e955554ebf610901660799751e682df4d53bf5a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:093a22b7a47c8923c8acdf8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在『天皇赏（秋）』『日本杯』等赛事中，\n她确实一路飞跃为不受后冠路线框架所限的\n“女帝”，这正是对那份气概的传承。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a0a803be6aa6cb65b8eca02b878eeff76667ac4676877629165a737d75db840",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:659d2662312eb40bfc061977",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
